        <p><b>5.</b> (a) <b>Merge sort</b>, because it is stable (or <code>Arrays.sort</code> on objects, which is a stable merge sort). (b) <b>Heap sort</b>: about n × log₂ n even in the worst case, and no extra array.</p>
      </div></details>
